Rationale: semantic tokens separate reusable intent from specific values and support consistent variation.
Token groups: color.surface, color.text, color.border, color.action, color.status; type.family, type.scale, type.weight, type.leading; space.1–space.8; radius.sm–radius.lg; elevation.1–elevation.3; motion.fast–motion.standard.
Gate coverage: contrast AA, scalable text, non-color status cues, spacing consistency, reduced-motion behavior, and documented fallbacks.
Path intent: repository/f/tokens/token-map.mmd; keep names stable and values neutral.
Writing rule: descriptions state purpose rather than affiliation or visual personality.
Publishing rule: record impact, refresh specimens, and complete visual and accessibility checks before release.